        "format": "main",
        "title": "The Thing Pulling You Down Is Your Engine",
        "description": "Spacecraft reach the outer planets by using the pull they could never fight. So can you.",
        "tags": [
          "space motivation",
          "discipline",
          "voyager",
          "gravity assist",
          "mindset",
          "self improvement",
